*> MISSION: Demonstrate End-Of-File (EOF) Detection.
*> cobc -x -j -free EX_PARAGS_05.cob
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EX_PARAGS.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
*> Update to where YOU saved this file:
SELECT JUSTA-FILE ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
    ASSIGN TO '/home/profnagy/Desktop/cobol/EX_PARAGS_05.cob'.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A-LINE     PIC X(132) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-EOF     PIC X      VALUE 'N'.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
OPEN INPUT JUSTA-FILE.
PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
    READ JUSTA-FILE INTO A-LINE
    AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        DISPLAY 'done!'
    NOT AT END DISPLAY '[' A-LINE ']'
END-PERFORM.

CLOSE JUSTA-FILE.
DISPLAY "Normal End-Of Job!"
GOBACK.
